// BT-3841 (ADR 0131): a class that defines `keysAndValuesDo:` / `doWithKey:`
// itself. Its instance is not a `Dictionary`, so the compiled keyed fold, which
// is inlined for a `Dictionary` receiver only, must not iterate it as one. See
// stdlib/test/adr0131keyed_do_test.bt.

Value subclass: Adr0131KeyedDoCustom

  keysAndValuesDo: aBlock => aBlock value: 1 value: 2

  doWithKey: aBlock => aBlock value: 1 value: 2
